DESCRIPTION:GROCERY SHOPPING LIST\n==================================================\n\n• Boneless Chicken Thighs: 2 \n• Cauliflower: 0.5 unit\n• Chicken Thighs: 2 unit\n• Chopped Whole Chicken: 500 g\n• Diced Pepper: 1 unit\n• Dried Chili Peppers: 100 gram\n• Egg: 2 unit\n• Firm Tofu: 1 block\n• Garlic: 2 clove\n• Garlic Powder: 1 tablespoon\n• Garlic Sprouts: 3 unit\n• Ginger: 1 tablespoon\n• Green Onion: 3 unit\n• Green Pepper: 1 unit\n• Lemon: 0.5 unit\n• Mango: 1 unit\n• Onion: 0.5 unit\n• Oyster Sauce: 1 tablespoon\n• Paprika: 1 tablespoon\n• Peeled And Seeded Sweet Pumpkin: 600 gram\n• Pixian Doubanjiang 郫县豆瓣酱: 1 tablespoon\n• Rice Wine: 1 tablespoon\n• Salt: 1.25 teaspoon\n• Sesame Oil: 1.5 tablespoon\n• Shrimp: 1 lb\n• Sichuan Peppercorns: 15 gram\n• Silken Tofu: 1 box\n• Soy Sauce: 7 tablespoon\n• Soybean Paste: 2 tablespoon\n• Sugar: 1 tablespoon\n• Tomato: 1 unit\n• Vegetable Oil: 2 tablespoon\n• Vinegar: 2 tablespoon\n• White Sesame: 1 tablespoon\n• White Sugar: 50 gram\n• Any Vegetables: as needed\n• Any Vegetables Or Proteins: as needed\n• Black Pepper: as needed\n• Chicken Powder: as needed\n• Cilantro: as needed\n• Cooking Oil: as needed\n• Goji Berries: as needed\n• Hot Pepper Sauce: as needed\n• Meat: as needed\n• Oil: as needed\n• Olive Oil: as needed\n• Parsley Flakes: as needed\n• Pepper: as needed\n• Red Dates: as needed\n• Scallions: as needed\n• Sweet Potato Vermicelli: as needed\n• Various Vegetables: as needed\n• White Sesame Seeds: as needed\n• Dried Mushrooms: Any (shiitake mushrooms\, bamboo fungus\, cordyceps flower\, tea tree mushrooms\, morels\, chanterelles\, king oyster mushrooms)\n• Starch: a pinch\n\nTotal ingredients: 55
